CleanShelf - a Batocera theme
=============================

CleanShelf is a modified version of "Sheezie2Clean" by Sheezie (newFUNKYmode),
https://github.com/Sheezie/Sheezie2Clean

Licence
-------

Sheezie2Clean declares its licence as "creative commons CC-BY-NC-SA" (theme.xml
header) and states that the theme is not authorized for commercial use. It does
not name a version of that licence. Everything taken from Sheezie2Clean stays
under those terms, as Sheezie declared them.

CleanShelf's own additions and changes (the generated system folders and
wordmarks, the fallback views, the tools/ scripts, the Pygame artwork, the
"RomM Detailed" view and the documentation) are offered under the Creative
Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence
(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

In short: you may share and adapt this theme if you give credit, do not use it
commercially, and release your changes under the same terms.

THIS THEME IS NOT AUTHORIZED FOR COMMERCIAL USE.

